  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ruwwad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ruwwad aims to economically empower women and youth in West Ramallah (Ni&#x2019;lin, Qibya, Budrus) through home- and village-based enterprises. The project addresses unemployment worsened by the October 7th war. A transparent call will select 28 participants for one-month business training. Mini-grants will be provided to support project launch or expansion. Marketing support includes bazaars and links with private sector platforms. 50% of funds target existing women entrepreneurs, 45% for male youth with vocational skills, and5% for current Ruwwad women. The initiative also promotes community protection and psychosocial wellbeing.</narrative>
  </description>
